tesla,2026-08,517000,3236000,3079800,3741000,467000,615000,1,1,1,1,1,1,2026-10-15,"Second month on Tesla's no-monitor miles (method in the 2026-07 row). August: 483,680 on the page, 467,685 in the deck; floor 467,000. The central, 517,000, adds June's 33,000 monitor-aboard remainder: monitor-aboard driving continued (NHTSA report 13781-16672, an Austin crash in August with 'a safety monitor present in the vehicle', is the only Tesla report since May 23 that Tesla's own no-monitor list leaves out); the top, 615,000, keeps the monitor-aboard share at or below June's 21%. The page's series reproduces Tesla's Sep-3 '1 million miles of unsupervised Robotaxi operation' (1,035,164 by Sep 3). The cumulative band's floor through Aug 31, 3,079,800, is the end-June floor (2,366,800: the deck's 2.44M less ~3% read noise) plus the July and August floors."
